1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,033
My mouth is dry as paper. And I'm
surrounded by water. Just one handful.

2
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:08,067
I can hear you chewing. Do not eat
that snow.

3
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:14,067
Rule six. Never eat snow. Melt it
first. Your body pays for every bite
with heat.

4
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:18,300
One candle. One pot. Forty minutes for
one mouthful of water.
